17
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:07,130
For this software exercise,
enter zero point two five hours.

18
00:01:07,559 --> 00:01:10,449
The Date field indicates
that it defaults to today.

19
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:14,100
We enter Training software
demonstration as the category

20
00:01:14,319 --> 00:01:18,039
