with Not verified by the department yet.

44
00:02:43,359 --> 00:02:46,200
Read that state before treating
the update as reviewed.

45
00:02:46,700 --> 00:02:49,170
The education entry remains visible below.

46
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:54,420
This same habit supports fire and
